OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed as police deal with
OL,4,Arooftop incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road in Coventry was closed and
OL,7,Fdrivers faced disruption while
OL,8,Femergency services responded to an
OL,9,Fincident involving a man on the roof of
OL,10,Fa building.
OL,12,FPolice were called to Foleshill Road at
OL,13,Fabout 14:00 BST on Tuesday and remained
OL,14,Fat the scene for several hours
OL,15,Falongside other emergency services.
OL,17,FA West Midlands Police spokesperson
OL,18,Fsaid: "We are currently on Foleshill
OL,19,FRoad along with other emergency
OL,20,Fservices due to a man being on the roof
OL,21,Fof a building.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
