OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed as police deal with
OL,4,Arooftop incident
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Officers are talking to the man in an
OL,7,Feffort to bring the incident to a safe
OL,8,Fconclusion." The road reopened at about
OL,9,F17:30, according to the council.
